  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life-saving WASH and Shelter&amp;NFI assistance to host communities and IDPs affected by cyclone Mocha in Rakhine State, Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s aim is to meet emergency WASH and Shelter&amp;NFI needs of cyclone affected communities and manage the impact of shock, through water trucking, rehabilitation of water sources and distribution of hygiene items and shelter materials.</narrative>
